  "_comment": "v6 baseboard routing pass 1 (tools/v6/route/chain.sh). Rules as the v5 passes: 0.2 mm tracks, 0.15 mm clearance, 0.4572 / 0.3 vias, 0.05 mm grid. Per-net 2.5 mm high-voltage clearances: hv_clearances.json (route steps), sense_clearances.json (the side-1 HV nets of U4 / U5 among themselves).",
